    class="_reveal_b94b86 "
  >
    <section
      class="section"
      id="contribute"
    >
      <div
        class="container"
      >
        <h2>
          Contribute
        </h2>
        <div
          class="_content_ae15cf"
        >
          <div
            class="_setup_ae15cf"
          >
            <h3>
              1. Clone and install
            </h3>
            <div
              data-testid="code-block-mock"
            >
              CodeBlock Mock
            </div>
          </div>
          <div
            class="_setup_ae15cf"
          >
            <h3>
              2. Run the test suite
            </h3>
            <div
              data-testid="code-block-mock"
            >
              CodeBlock Mock
            </div>
            <blockquote
              class="_callout_ae15cf"
            >
              Coverage is enforced at 80% (branch coverage). The default invocation excludes 
              <code>
                e2e
              </code>
               tests, which require live GitHub and Claude API access. See 
              <a
                href="/docs/canary-setup"
              >
                Canary Setup
              </a>
               to configure those.
            </blockquote>
            <div
              data-testid="code-block-mock"
            >
              CodeBlock Mock
            </div>
          </div>
          <div
            class="_setup_ae15cf"
          >
            <h3>
              3. Code standards at a glance
            </h3>
            <div
              class="_tableWrapper_ae15cf"
            >
              <table
                class="_table_ae15cf"
              >
                <thead>
                  <tr>
                    <th
                      scope="col"
                    >
                      Standard
                    </th>
                    <th
                      scope="col"
                    >
                      Enforced by
                    </th>
                  </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                  <tr>
                    <td>
                      Type annotations (strict)
                    </td>
                    <td>
                      <code>
                        mypy --strict
                      </code>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td>
                      Linting
                    </td>
                    <td>
                      <code>
                        ruff
                      </code>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td>
                      Formatting
                    </td>
                    <td>
                      <code>
                        black
                      </code>
                       (100-char line length)
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td>
                      Immutable models
                    </td>
                    <td>
                      Pydantic 
                      <code>
                        frozen=True
                      </code>
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td>
                      Pure functions for prompt & render
                    </td>
                    <td>
                      Asserted by unit tests
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                  <tr>
                    <td>
                      No global state
                    </td>
                    <td>
                      Code review
                    </td>
                  </tr>
                </tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
            <p>
              CI runs lint → type-check → engine integrity hash → test on every PR. All gates must be green before merge.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div
          class="_workflow_ae15cf"
        >
          <h3>
            Contribution Workflow
          </h3>
          <ol>
            <li>
              Fork the repository and create a feature branch.
            </li>
            <li>
              Make your changes; ensure 
              <code>
                pytest
              </code>
               and 
              <code>
                mypy
              </code>
               pass locally.
            </li>
            <li>
              Use 
              <code>
                lychee review --dry-run --fixture tests/fixtures/pr_payload.json
              </code>
               to preview rendering changes without API calls.
            </li>
            <li>
              Open a PR — Lychee will review it automatically.
            </li>
          </ol>
        </div>
        <aside
          aria-label="Security reporting"
          class="_securityNotice_ae15cf"
        >
          <p>
            <strong>
              Found a security issue?
            </strong>
             Do not open a public GitHub issue. Email the maintainers directly or use GitHub's private vulnerability reporting (
            <strong>
              Security tab → Report a vulnerability
            </strong>
            ). We acknowledge within 48 hours and provide a fix timeline within 7 days.
          </p>
        </aside>
        <div
          class="_ctas_ae15cf"
        >
          <a
            class="_ctaLink_ae15cf"
            href="/docs/development"
          >
            Development guide →
          </a>
          <a
            class="_ctaLink_ae15cf"
            href="/docs/roadmap"
          >
            Roadmap →
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
